      <h2>Audio Summary: Mapping the LLM Training Pipeline</h2>
      <p>This article maps the training process of a modern frontier reasoning model from zero to final deployment. The lifecycle proceeds in four sequential stages: Pre-training, Mid-training, Supervised Fine-Tuning, and Reinforcement Learning. Pre-training uses massive web corpora to establish generic language capacity. Mid-training focuses the model on structured code repositories and math documents while progressively extending the context window up to one million tokens. SFT alignments add formatting consistency and reasoning placeholders using a masked-loss strategy on mistake paths.</p>
      <p>Finally, we outline the modern reinforcement learning paradigm, focusing on Reinforcement Learning with Verifiable Rewards (RLVR). By using compiler sandboxes or math test runners as objective, deterministic reward signals rather than learned preference models, RLVR prevents reward hacking and drives the emergence of reasoning and self-correction. Optimization is scaled using the GRPO algorithm, slime async rollout queues, and cross-stage KL teacher distillation.</p>
    </div>
    <div lang="zh">
      <h2>语音摘要：从零构建前沿模型：大语言模型训练阶段详解</h2>
      <p>本文系统地梳理了构建现代前沿大模型所需的四个关键训练阶段：预训练、中训练（Mid-training）、有监督微调（SFT）和强化学习。预训练使用海量通用网页数据来构建基础语言表示；中训练（Continued Pre-training）则通过融入大量代码和数学定理数据，并渐进式地将上下文窗口扩展到 100 万 Token，以建立长文本的提取和检索召回能力；SFT 有监督微调则通过引入 interleaved 思考链和 preserved 历史思考，结合错误动作的损失遮蔽，让模型学会符合交互逻辑的格式化表达。</p>
      <p>最后，文章深入阐明了基于确定性验证反馈的强化学习（RLVR）如何取代传统的人类偏好模型（RLHF）。通过利用编译器沙箱或数学等价性校验器提供客观的二元奖励（0 或 1），RLVR 克服了奖励作弊（Reward Hacking），强力催生出模型的自主探究与纠错行为。系统优化通过 GRPO 算法、slime 异步队列以及跨阶段 KL 教师蒸馏实现了大规模的高效训练。</p>
